  "message.maidfactory.bubble.hand_saw.first": "这个……是让我锯东西吗？",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.hand_saw.low.normal.1": "切起来……有点费劲呢。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.hand_saw.low.normal.2": "锯子好钝……是不是该磨了？",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.hand_saw.low.continuous.1": "我锯、我锯……手要断了。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.hand_saw.low.continuous.2": "再锯下去，我就要变成妖梦的双刀了……",
