  "message.maidfactory.bubble.press_hammer.low.continuous.2": "再砸下去，我就要变成萃香了……",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.press_hammer.low.durability.1": "锤头要飞了，真的。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.press_hammer.low.durability.2": "它快坏了，你管管它嘛。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.press_hammer.mid.normal.1": "压好了，力度差不多。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.press_hammer.mid.normal.2": "压完了，看看行不行？",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.press_hammer.mid.continuous.1": "连续压了这么久，手都震麻了。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.press_hammer.mid.continuous.2": "这阵仗，比萃香的宴会还热闹……",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.press_hammer.mid.durability.1": "该换了，我提醒过你。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.press_hammer.mid.durability.2": "再压两下就该换了。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.press_hammer.high.normal.1": "力度刚好，放心。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.press_hammer.high.normal.2": "砸得比萃香的葫芦还准哦。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.press_hammer.high.continuous.1": "放着吧，我顺手就压了。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.press_hammer.high.continuous.2": "这点量，还不够我砸的。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.press_hammer.high.durability.1": "换一把，这把留着当纪念。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.press_hammer.high.durability.2": "这锤子归我管，你别碰。",

  "message.maidfactory.bubble.infusion_gun.first": "这个……是让我注液体吗？",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.infusion_gun.low.normal.1": "别、别洒出来啊……",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.infusion_gun.low.normal.2": "这枪比咲夜的飞刀还难握……",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.infusion_gun.low.continuous.1": "注了这么久，我手都抖了……",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.infusion_gun.low.continuous.2": "再注下去，就要像咲夜小姐那样精准了……我还差得远。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.infusion_gun.low.durability.1": "它漏了！真的漏了！",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.infusion_gun.low.durability.2": "枪管在渗液，你快看看。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.infusion_gun.mid.normal.1": "注好了，量刚好。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.infusion_gun.mid.normal.2": "液体注完了，检查一下吧。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.infusion_gun.mid.continuous.1": "连续注了这么久，手腕都酸了。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.infusion_gun.mid.continuous.2": "这速度，快赶上咲夜的飞刀了……",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.infusion_gun.mid.durability.1": "该修了，再漏就麻烦了。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.infusion_gun.mid.durability.2": "再注两下就该换了。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.infusion_gun.high.normal.1": "精准注入，不会洒的。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.infusion_gun.high.normal.2": "比咲夜的飞刀还精准，放心。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.infusion_gun.high.continuous.1": "放着吧，我顺手就注了。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.infusion_gun.high.continuous.2": "这点量，还不够我注的。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.infusion_gun.high.durability.1": "换一把，这把我来修。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.infusion_gun.high.durability.2": "这枪归我管，你别碰。",

  "message.maidfactory.bubble.stirring_staff.first": "这个……是让我搅东西吗？",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.stirring_staff.low.normal.1": "搅啊搅……好累。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.stirring_staff.low.normal.2": "这杖比看起来沉……",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.stirring_staff.low.continuous.1": "我搅、我搅……手要断了。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.stirring_staff.low.continuous.2": "再搅下去，就要变成魔理沙的扫帚了……",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.stirring_staff.low.durability.1": "它要断了啦……",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.stirring_staff.low.durability.2": "杖头在晃，你快看看。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.stirring_staff.mid.normal.1": "搅好了，很匀。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.stirring_staff.mid.normal.2": "搅完了，可以了吧？",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.stirring_staff.mid.continuous.1": "连续搅了这么久，胳膊都酸了。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.stirring_staff.mid.continuous.2": "搅了这么久，比八卦炉还费劲……",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.stirring_staff.mid.durability.1": "该换了，我搅不动了。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.stirring_staff.mid.durability.2": "再搅两下就该换了。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.stirring_staff.high.normal.1": "交给我吧，搅得很匀哦。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.stirring_staff.high.normal.2": "搅得比魔理沙的八卦炉还匀，放心。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.stirring_staff.high.continuous.1": "放着吧，我顺手就搅了。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.stirring_staff.high.continuous.2": "这点量，还不够我搅的。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.stirring_staff.high.durability.1": "换一把，这把归我管。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.stirring_staff.high.durability.2": "这杖归我管，你别碰。",

  "message.maidfactory.bubble.bellows.first": "这个……是让我吹风吗？",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.bellows.low.normal.1": "呼——呼——好累……",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.bellows.low.normal.2": "吹风比想象中费劲呢……",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.bellows.low.continuous.1": "我吹、我吹……脸都酸了。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.bellows.low.continuous.2": "再吹下去，就要变成文文了……",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.bellows.low.durability.1": "它漏风了！真的！",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.bellows.low.durability.2": "风箱在漏气，你快看看。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.bellows.mid.normal.1": "吹好了，火候差不多。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.bellows.mid.normal.2": "吹完了，看看行不行？",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.bellows.mid.continuous.1": "连续吹了这么久，腮帮子都酸了。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.bellows.mid.continuous.2": "这风，比天狗的团扇还猛……",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.bellows.mid.durability.1": "该修了，再漏就白吹了。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.bellows.mid.durability.2": "再吹两下就该换了。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.bellows.high.normal.1": "火候正好，放心。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.bellows.high.normal.2": "吹得比天狗的团扇还猛，放心。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.bellows.high.continuous.1": "放着吧，我顺手就吹了。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.bellows.high.continuous.2": "这点量，还不够我吹的。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.bellows.high.durability.1": "换一把，这把我来养。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.bellows.high.durability.2": "这风箱归我管，你别碰。",

  "message.maidfactory.bubble.pointer.first": "这个……是让我放东西吗？",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.pointer.low.normal.1": "放、放哪里好呢……",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.pointer.low.normal.2": "这东西好难对准……",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.pointer.low.continuous.1": "放了这么久，我眼都花了……",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.pointer.low.continuous.2": "再放下去，就要像爱丽丝的人偶那样多了……",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.pointer.low.durability.1": "它要歪了啦……",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.pointer.low.durability.2": "杆头在晃，你快看看。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.pointer.mid.normal.1": "部署完成，放好了。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.pointer.mid.normal.2": "放好了，检查一下吧。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.pointer.mid.continuous.1": "连续放了这么久，眼睛都酸了。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.pointer.mid.continuous.2": "这手法，快赶上爱丽丝的魔法了……",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.pointer.mid.durability.1": "该换了，再歪就对不上了。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.pointer.mid.durability.2": "再放两下就该换了。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.pointer.high.normal.1": "部署完成，很准哦。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.pointer.high.normal.2": "放得比爱丽丝的人偶还准，放心。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.pointer.high.continuous.1": "放着吧，我顺手就放了。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.pointer.high.continuous.2": "这点量，还不够我放的。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.pointer.high.durability.1": "换一把，这把归我管。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.pointer.high.durability.2": "这杆归我管，你别碰。",

  "message.maidfactory.bubble.crusher_mortar.first": "这个……是让我碾东西吗？",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.crusher_mortar.low.normal.1": "碾、碾不动……好硬。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.crusher_mortar.low.normal.2": "这碾钵比研钵还沉……",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.crusher_mortar.low.continuous.1": "我碾、我碾……手要断了。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.crusher_mortar.low.continuous.2": "再碾下去，就要变成慧音的头槌了……",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.crusher_mortar.low.durability.1": "它快散架了，你管管它嘛。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.crusher_mortar.low.durability.2": "碾钵要裂了，真的。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.crusher_mortar.mid.normal.1": "碾完了，下一个。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.crusher_mortar.mid.normal.2": "碾好了，看看行不行？",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.crusher_mortar.mid.continuous.1": "连续碾了这么久，胳膊都酸了。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.crusher_mortar.mid.continuous.2": "碾了这么久，比寺子屋的功课还磨人……",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.crusher_mortar.mid.durability.1": "再碾两下就该换了。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.crusher_mortar.mid.durability.2": "该修了，别装没看见。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.crusher_mortar.high.normal.1": "碾好了，很细哦。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.crusher_mortar.high.normal.2": "碾得比慧音的头槌还碎，放心。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.crusher_mortar.high.continuous.1": "放着吧，我顺手就碾了。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.crusher_mortar.high.continuous.2": "这点量，还不够我碾的。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.crusher_mortar.high.durability.1": "换一把，这把我来养。",
  "message.maidfactory.bubble.crusher_mortar.high.durability.2": "这碾钵归我管，你别碰。"
}